### Page 1 of 6

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

November 7, 2022
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-4-23 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and
Aztec Construction Co., Inc., for the Cheyenne Fire Rescue - Site 1 Utility Main
Extensions project
______________________________________________
Bid #S-4-23 was solicited for the Cheyenne Fire Rescue - Site 1 Utility Main Extensions project.
A project vicinity map is included for reference.

Two (2) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Bids were received from:
1. Aztec Construction Co. Inc. Cheyenne, Wyoming.

2. Mechanical Systems Incorporated. Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by John Kopper (Cheyenne Fire Rescue), Byron Mathews (Cheyenne Fire
Rescue), and the design team (PlanOne Architects & KL&A Architects and Builders), and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Aztec Construction Co. Inc.

The Bid Award amount is requested for $663,681.00, which includes the Base Bid Amount for the
project, as well as inclusion of Bid Alternate One for Directional Boring/Drilling under Converse
Avenue.  The Directional Boring/Drilling will reduce impacts relating to street closure on
Converse Avenue.

Funding:
025-21-2111-40-46504 (American Rescue Plan Federal Recovery Funds (ARPA))
Project #210079
```

